cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "leakcalc: reference implementations of published methods for estimating compressed-air leak repair savings"
abstract: >-
  Python implementations of the leak-savings methods in the IAC training manual
  (Essentials of Industrial Assessments v3.0), the Self-Assessment Workbook for Small
  Manufacturers v2.0, DOE Compressed Air Tip Sheet #3, UMP Chapter 22, and Schmidt &
  Kissock (2004, 2005), each checked against the worked examples printed in its source.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tao
    given-names: Ran
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-2665-0745"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
keywords:
  - compressed air
  - leak repair
  - energy savings
  - industrial energy assessment
  - measurement and verification
